<title>USA: Akron, Ohio, repriced, top yield cut to 5.52 pct.</title>
<headline>Akron, Ohio, repriced, top yield cut to 5.52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Edwards &amp; Sons said Tuesday it repriced Akron, Ohio's $13.5 million bond deal, adjusting yields in several maturities and lowering the top yield in 2017 to 5.52 percent from 5.55 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>CITY OF AKRON, OHIO</p>
<p>RE: $13,520,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS (LIMITED TAX)</p>
<p>VARIOUS PURPOSE IMPROVEMENT BONDS, SERIES 1996-2</p>
<p>THE VERBAL AWARD HAS BEEN RECEIVED.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>REPRICING AS FOLLOWS:</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: A		     S&amp;P: AA-		   FITCH: AA-</p>
<p>  DATED: 12/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 06/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>12/01/1998		  705M    3.95  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/1999		  710M    4.15  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/2000		  705M    4.30  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/2001		  705M    4.40  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/2002		  705M    4.50  %	100.00</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>12/01/2003		  700M    4.60  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/2004		  695M    4.70  %	100.00</p>
<p>12/01/2005		  695M    6.125 %	  4.875</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 108.992)</p>
<p>12/01/2006		  695M    6.125 %	  4.975</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 108.95 )</p>
<p>12/01/2007		  695M    6.125 %	  5.075</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 108.747)</p>
<p>12/01/2008		  655M    5.00  %	  5.10</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.11 )</p>
