<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 98.209)</p>
<p>*SINKING FUND BEGINS 12/01/12  100</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 12/01/2007    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, November 27, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 12, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>McDonald &amp; Company Securities, Inc.</p>
